    "sub_name": "企業管理專業實習(二)",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS MANAGEMENT INTERNSHIP (2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為遴選學生提供至企業進行實務實習的課程，其目的在加強企業管理理論與實務的整合，以強化學生專業技能，提升未來就業的競爭力。本課程為下學期實習。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides prospective students internship opportunities in industrial institutions to learn practically. The purpose is to strengthen students’ comprehensive understanding of the interaction between theories of business management and practices, and in turn to improve students’ expertise as well as competitiveness in their future career. This course is for the second semester.",
